From b4b7280784791b2d8a9dba01fdd21dd9c6a501e6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tal Zatelman <tal.pixeld@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 13:26:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(platform-admin): P5.2 Customer 360 organization control
 center
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Turns the P5.1 minimal org summary into a real Customer 360 at
/platform/customers/[orgId]: a tabbed org record (Overview, Users, Product
Usage, Marketing & Distribution, Integrations, Activity, Access, Operations,
Billing) for ZONO staff. READ / DIAGNOSE / NAVIGATE only — no destructive or
financially sensitive actions.

Security: every read goes through the audited platform DAL (no service-role
client in any page/component), is explicitly scoped to the target orgId AFTER
the capability check, returns count-only/minimal DTOs, and never selects a
token/secret/credential column. Sections are gated by independent capabilities
(usage/integrations/ops/billing/flags/entitlements) so e.g. a support operator
gets no billing or operational data.

Data: honest metrics mapped to authoritative sources; restricted/unavailable
never rendered as 0; deterministic explainable health chips (no scoring model);
AI cost intentionally omitted (no schema). Directory upgraded with search + plan
filter + sort (no N+1). New P5.2 QA (authorization, tenancy binding, DTO safety,
route/cap). No migrations.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Cm5NAh92cekdimerQbEsCW
